{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Typing :: Stubs Only"], "description": "## Typing stubs for tqdm\n\nThis is a [type stub package](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/tutorials/external_libraries.html)\nfor the [`tqdm`](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm) package. It can be used by type checkers\nto check code that uses `tqdm`. This version of\n`types-tqdm` aims to provide accurate annotations for\n`tqdm==4.70.*`.\n\nThis package is part of the [typeshed project](https://github.com/python/typeshed).\nAll fixes for types and metadata should be contributed there.\nSee [the README](https://github.com/python/typeshed/blob/main/README.md)\nfor more details. The source for this package can be found in the\n[`stubs/tqdm`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/tree/main/stubs/tqdm)\ndirectory.\n\nThis package was tested with the following type checkers:\n* [mypy](https://www.mypy-lang.org/) 2.4.1\n* [pyrefly](https://pyrefly.org/) 1.4.0\n* [pyright](https://microsoft.github.io/pyright/) 1.1.414\n* [ty](https://docs.astral.sh/ty/) 0.0.94\n\nIt was generated from typeshed commit\n[`64c9da7d22492efa44d1ca06b8d82c1bf6aed74f`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/commit/64c9da7d22492efa44d1ca06b8d82c1bf6aed74f).\n\n## Optional dependencies\n\nSome stubs depend on third-party libraries that are not required by every user.\nThe following extras are available:\n\n```console\npip install 'types-tqdm[all]' # installs all optional dependencies\npip install 'types-tqdm[requests]' # installs requests>=2.34.0\npip install 'types-tqdm[tensorflow]' # installs types-tensorflow\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["License-File"], "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": "Apache-2.0", "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "types-tqdm", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/types-tqdm/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/types-tqdm/", "project_urls": {"Changes": "https://github.com/typeshed-internal/stub_uploader/blob/main/data/changelogs/tqdm.md", "Chat": "https://gitter.im/python/typing", "GitHub": "https://github.com/python/typeshed", "Homepage": "https://github.com/python/typeshed", "Issue tracker": "https://github.com/python/typeshed/issues"}, "provides_extra": ["all", "requests", "tensorflow"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/types-tqdm/4.70.0.20261106/", "requires_dist": ["requests>=2.34.0; extra == \"all\"", "types-tensorflow; extra == \"all\"", "requests>=2.34.0; extra == \"requests\"", "types-tensorflow; extra == \"tensorflow\""], "requires_python": ">=3.10", "summary": "Typing stubs for tqdm", "version": "4.70.0.20261106", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"4.64.0": "2022-07-05T18:22:47.874514Z", "4.64.1": "2022-07-07T12:38:58.118319Z", "4.64.2": "2022-07-12T15:26:56.110466Z", "4.64.3": "2022-07-15T12:40:35.643601Z", "4.64.4": "2022-07-15T18:23:29.494260Z", "4.64.5": "2022-08-18T21:17:22.831700Z", "4.64.6": "2022-08-24T12:38:29.111042Z", "4.64.7": "2022-09-27T02:09:26.425040Z", "4.64.7.1": "2022-10-16T12:42:14.413249Z", "4.64.7.10": "2023-01-13T09:17:50.882954Z", "4.64.7.11": "2023-01-18T15:17:59.412529Z", "4.64.7.12": "2023-02-07T01:21:17.715839Z", "4.64.7.13": "2023-02-15T12:34:41.685505Z", "4.64.7.14": "2023-02-21T01:28:26.852967Z", "4.64.7.15": "2023-02-21T12:32:44.034517Z", "4.64.7.16": "2023-02-26T01:38:50.388333Z", "4.64.7.2": "2022-11-08T18:29:08.527395Z", "4.64.7.3": "2022-11-11T01:51:03.749514Z", "4.64.7.4": "2022-11-22T21:15:23.544747Z", "4.64.7.5": "2022-11-23T01:27:54.741130Z", "4.64.7.6": "2022-11-23T03:33:48.094649Z", "4.64.7.7": "2022-11-23T06:22:26.854141Z", "4.64.7.8": "2022-11-23T09:17:30.377816Z", "4.64.7.9": "2022-11-23T12:35:21.182201Z", "4.65.0.0": "2023-03-04T18:19: